  "description": "GemBox.Bundle is a package of .NET components for processing spreadsheets, documents, presentations, email messages, and images (XLSX, DOCX, PPTX, PDF, MSG, and PNG) from .NET applications.\nWith GemBox.Bundle you get fast and reliable components that are easy to use and don't depend on Microsoft Office or Adobe Acrobat. They require only .NET so you can deploy your applications without having to think about other licenses.",
